{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"MediaWiki REST revision HTML, sanitized","nodeCount":513,"content":[{"type":"section","props":{"id":"mwAQ"},"children":[{"type":"div","props":{"id":"mwAg"},"children":[]},{"type":"div","props":{"id":"mwAw"},"children":["\n",{"type":"div","props":{},"children":[{"type":"div","props":{},"children":[{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["In-Game Reward information"]}]},"\n",{"type":"div","props":{},"children":["\n",{"type":"hr","props":{},"children":[]},"\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":[{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["It is not possible to get the virtual item attached to this product unless bought through the Roblox commercial store, which is the Merch Shop in the lobby."]},{"type":"br","props":{},"children":[]},"Only players that reside in the United States of America, and are over the age of 13 (unless residing in the state of Texas, where this is over the age of 18) can access this store. Players outside the United States of America are able to purchase the physical product via ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"https://shop.paradoxum.games/"},"children":["Paradoxum Games store"]}," but will not get the virtual item attached to this product."]},"\n"]}]}]},"\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":[]}]},{"type":"section","props":{"id":"mwBQ"},"children":[{"type":"section","props":{"id":"mwBw"},"children":[{"type":"h2","props":{"id":"Cowboy_Plush"},"children":["Cowboy Plush"]},"\n"]},{"type":"span","props":{"id":"mwCA"},"children":["\n\n\n"]},{"type":"p","props":{},"children":[]},{"type":"span","props":{"id":"mwCg"},"children":["\n\n"]},"\n","\n"]},{"type":"section","props":{"id":"mwDQ"},"children":[{"type":"h2","props":{"id":"Description"},"children":["Description"]},"\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":["The ",{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Cowboy Plush"]}," is an upcoming official Paradoxum Games toy which is currently available to be pre-ordered. It was made by Juniper Creates. The plushie offers the Level 4 ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Cowboy","title":"Cowboy"},"children":["Cowboy"]},". Anybody who bought the toy from the in-game Merch Store will receive the ",{"type":"b","props":{},"children":[{"type":"span","props":{},"children":["Umbra"]}]}," skin for the ",{"type":"b","props":{},"children":[{"type":"span","props":{},"children":["Plushie"]}]}," skin for the ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Cowboy","title":"Cowboy"},"children":["Cowboy"]},". If bought on the ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"https://shop.paradoxum.games/"},"children":["Paradoxum Games store"]},", it will not come with any rewards."]},"\n\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":["The revolvers of the ",{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Cowboy Plush"]}," are detachable. It is made out of plush fabric and polypropylene cotton, its size measures 13 inches (33.02 cm) tall, 10.6 inches (26.924 cm) wide and 11.8 inches (29.972 cm) long. A tree is planted for every order of the plush."]},"\n\n"]},{"type":"section","props":{"id":"mwFw"},"children":[{"type":"h2","props":{"id":"Official_Description"},"children":["Official Description"]},"\n",{"type":"ul","props":{},"children":[{"type":"li","props":{},"children":[{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Online (Third)"]},"\n",{"type":"dl","props":{},"children":[{"type":"dd","props":{},"children":["Howdy partner, the fan favorite Cowboy tower is here as a plush and he is packing some heat with his removable revolvers. This plush does not include an in-game reward."]}]}]},"\n",{"type":"li","props":{},"children":[{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Online (Second)"]},"\n",{"type":"dl","props":{},"children":[{"type":"dd","props":{},"children":["Howdy partner, the fan favorite Cowboy tower is here as a plush and he is packing some heat with his removable revolvers. The in-game reward is only included with purchases made in Roblox. Items purchased from shop.paradoxum.games do not include an in-game reward."]}]}]},"\n",{"type":"li","props":{},"children":[{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["